    \item \textbf{Platform}: Polkadot parachains (1K TPS) for high-volume PPV; Solana for ultra-low fees.
    \item \textbf{Innovation}: Dynamic pricing via CCIP oracles; sub-\$0.01 transactions.
\end{itemize}

\subsection{Purchase Model}

